{
  "john.20.p1.b1": {
    "text": "七日的第一日清早，天还黑的时候，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "七⁠日的第⁠一日清⁠早，天还黑的时⁠候，"
  },
  "john.20.p1.b2": {
    "text": "抹大拉的马利亚来到坟墓那里，看见石头从坟墓挪开了，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "抹⁠大⁠拉的马⁠利⁠亚来⁠到坟⁠墓那⁠里，看⁠见石⁠头从坟⁠墓挪⁠开了，"
  },
  "john.20.p1.b3": {
    "text": "有人把主从坟墓里挪了去，我们不知道放在哪里。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有⁠人把主从坟⁠墓里挪了去，我⁠们不⁠知⁠道放⁠在哪⁠里。"
  },
  "john.20.p2.b1": {
    "text": "彼得和那门徒就出来，往坟墓那里去。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "彼⁠得和那门⁠徒就出⁠来，往坟⁠墓那⁠里去。"
  },
  "john.20.p2.b2": {
    "text": "两个人同跑，那门徒比彼得跑得更快，先到了坟墓，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "两个⁠人同跑，那门⁠徒比彼⁠得跑⁠得更快，先到⁠了坟⁠墓，"
  },
  "john.20.p2.b3": {
    "text": "低头往里看，就见细麻布还放在那里，只是没有进去。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "低⁠头往⁠里看，就见细⁠麻⁠布还放⁠在那⁠里，只⁠是没⁠有进⁠去。"
  },
  "john.20.p3.b1": {
    "text": "西门·彼得随后也到了，进坟墓里去，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "西⁠门·彼⁠得随⁠后也到⁠了，进坟⁠墓里去，"
  },
  "john.20.p3.b2": {
    "text": "又看见耶稣的裹头巾没有和细麻布放在一处，是另在一处卷着。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "又看⁠见耶⁠稣的裹头⁠巾没⁠有和细⁠麻⁠布放⁠在一处，是另在一处卷着。"
  },
  "john.20.p3.b3": {
    "text": "先到坟墓的那门徒也进去，看见就信了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "先⁠到坟⁠墓的那门⁠徒也进⁠去，看⁠见就信了。"
  },
  "john.20.p4.b1": {
    "text": "因为他们还不明白圣经的意思，就是耶稣必要从死里复活。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠为他⁠们还不明⁠白圣⁠经的意⁠思，就⁠是耶⁠稣必⁠要从死里复⁠活。"
  },
  "john.20.p4.b2": {
    "text": "于是两个门徒回自己的住处去了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "于⁠是两个门⁠徒回自⁠己的住⁠处去⁠了。"
  },
  "john.20.p4.b3": {
    "text": "马利亚却站在坟墓外面哭。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "马⁠利⁠亚却站⁠在坟⁠墓外⁠面哭。"
  },
  "john.20.p4.b4": {
    "text": "哭的时候，低头往坟墓里看，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "哭的时⁠候，低⁠头往坟⁠墓里看，"
  },
  "john.20.p5.b1": {
    "text": "就见两个天使，穿着白衣，在安放耶稣身体的地方坐着，一个在头，一个在脚。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就见两个天⁠使，穿⁠着白⁠衣，在安⁠放耶⁠稣身⁠体的地⁠方坐着，一⁠个在头，一⁠个在脚。"
  },
  "john.20.p5.b2": {
    "text": "妇人，你为什么哭？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "妇⁠人，你为⁠什⁠么哭？"
  },
  "john.20.p5.b3": {
    "text": "因为有人把我主挪了去，我不知道放在哪里。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "因⁠为有⁠人把我主挪了去，我不⁠知⁠道放⁠在哪⁠里。"
  },
  "john.20.p6.b1": {
    "text": "说了这话，就转过身来，看见耶稣站在那里，却不知道是耶稣。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "说了这话，就转过身来，看⁠见耶⁠稣站⁠在那⁠里，却不⁠知⁠道是耶⁠稣。"
  },
  "john.20.p6.b2": {
    "text": "妇人，为什么哭？你找谁呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "妇⁠人，为⁠什⁠么哭？你⁠找谁呢？"
  },
  "john.20.p6.b3": {
    "text": "马利亚以为是看园的，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "马⁠利⁠亚以⁠为⁠是看园的，"
  },
  "john.20.p6.b4": {
    "text": "先生，若是你把他移了去，请告诉我，你把他放在哪里，我便去取他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "先⁠生，若⁠是你把他移了去，请告⁠诉我，你把他放⁠在哪⁠里，我便⁠去取他。"
  },
  "john.20.p7.b1": {
    "text": "马利亚。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "马⁠利⁠亚。"
  },
  "john.20.p7.b2": {
    "text": "拉波尼！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "拉⁠波⁠尼！"
  },
  "john.20.p7.b3": {
    "text": "拉波尼就是夫子的意思。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "拉⁠波⁠尼就⁠是夫⁠子的意⁠思。"
  },
  "john.20.p8.b1": {
    "text": "不要摸我，因我还没有升上去见我的父。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "不⁠要摸我，因我⁠还没⁠有升⁠上⁠去见我⁠的父。"
  },
  "john.20.p8.b2": {
    "text": "你往我弟兄那里去，告诉他们说，我要升上去见我的父，也是你们的父，见我的　神，也是你们的　神。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你往我弟⁠兄那⁠里去，告⁠诉他⁠们说，我⁠要升⁠上⁠去见我⁠的父，也⁠是你⁠们的父，见我⁠的　神，也⁠是你⁠们的　神。"
  },
  "john.20.p8.b3": {
    "text": "我已经看见了主。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我已⁠经看⁠见了主。"
  },
  "john.20.p8.b4": {
    "text": "她又将主对她说的这话告诉他们。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "她又将主对她说⁠的这话告⁠诉他⁠们。"
  },
  "john.20.p9.b1": {
    "text": "那日（就是七日的第一日）晚上，门徒所在的地方，因怕犹太人，门都关了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那日（就⁠是七⁠日的第⁠一日）晚⁠上，门⁠徒所⁠在的地⁠方，因怕犹⁠太⁠人，门都关⁠了。"
  },
  "john.20.p9.b2": {
    "text": "耶稣来，站在当中，对他们说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣来，站⁠在当⁠中，对他⁠们说："
  },
  "john.20.p9.b3": {
    "text": "愿你们平安！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "愿你⁠们平⁠安！"
  },
  "john.20.p9.b4": {
    "text": "说了这话，就把手和肋旁指给他们看。门徒看见主，就喜乐了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "说了这话，就把⁠手和肋旁指给他⁠们看。门⁠徒看⁠见主，就喜⁠乐了。"
  },
  "john.20.p10.b1": {
    "text": "愿你们平安！父怎样差遣了我，我也照样差遣你们。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "愿你⁠们平⁠安！父怎⁠样差⁠遣了我，我⁠也照⁠样差⁠遣你⁠们。"
  },
  "john.20.p10.b2": {
    "text": "你们受圣灵！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们受圣⁠灵！"
  },
  "john.20.p10.b3": {
    "text": "你们赦免谁的罪，谁的罪就赦免了；你们留下谁的罪，谁的罪就留下了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们赦⁠免谁的罪，谁的罪就赦⁠免了；你⁠们留⁠下谁的罪，谁的罪就留⁠下了。"
  },
  "john.20.p11.b1": {
    "text": "那十二个门徒中，有称为低土马的多马；耶稣来的时候，他没有和他们同在。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那十⁠二⁠个门⁠徒中，有称⁠为低土马的多⁠马；耶⁠稣来的时⁠候，他没⁠有和他⁠们同在。"
  },
  "john.20.p11.b2": {
    "text": "我们已经看见主了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠们已⁠经看⁠见主了。"
  },
  "john.20.p11.b3": {
    "text": "我非看见他手上的钉痕，用指头探入那钉痕，又用手探入他的肋旁，我总不信。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我非看⁠见他手⁠上的钉⁠痕，用指⁠头探入那钉⁠痕，又用手探入他⁠的肋旁，我总不⁠信。"
  },
  "john.20.p12.b1": {
    "text": "过了八日，门徒又在屋里，多马也和他们同在，门都关了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "过了八⁠日，门⁠徒又⁠在屋里，多⁠马也和他⁠们同在，门都关⁠了。"
  },
  "john.20.p12.b2": {
    "text": "愿你们平安！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "愿你⁠们平⁠安！"
  },
  "john.20.p12.b3": {
    "text": "伸过你的指头来，摸我的手；伸出你的手来，探入我的肋旁。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "伸⁠过你⁠的指⁠头来，摸我⁠的手；伸⁠出你⁠的手来，探入我⁠的肋旁。"
  },
  "john.20.p12.b4": {
    "text": "不要疑惑，总要信！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "不⁠要疑⁠惑，总要信！"
  },
  "john.20.p13.b1": {
    "text": "我的主！我的　神！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠的主！我⁠的　神！"
  },
  "john.20.p13.b2": {
    "text": "你因看见了我才信；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你因看⁠见了我才信；"
  },
  "john.20.p13.b3": {
    "text": "那没有看见就信的有福了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那没⁠有看⁠见就信的有⁠福了。"
  },
  "john.20.p14.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣在门徒面前另外行了许多神迹，没有记在这书上。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣在门⁠徒面⁠前另⁠外行了许⁠多神⁠迹，没⁠有记在这书上。"
  },
  "john.20.p14.b2": {
    "text": "但记这些事要叫你们信耶稣是基督，是　神的儿子，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "但记这⁠些事要叫你⁠们信耶⁠稣是基⁠督，是　神的儿⁠子，"
  },
  "john.20.p14.b3": {
    "text": "并且叫你们信了他，就可以因他的名得生命。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 20:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "并⁠且叫你⁠们信了他，就可⁠以因他⁠的名得生⁠命。"
  }
}
